%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b3f2a8c8f344355b16a4d4296ae3f98, type: 3}
  m_Name: Stoat
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  vesselClass: 15
  entries:
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: Catch Orbit
    AbilityDescription: 'Triggers: LT the left orbit, RT the right. A press lays a light black hole and its white
      hole ahead of you, the black hole on the pressed side, spinning clockwise on the right and
      anti-clockwise on the left. Fly past it on that side and it catches you, then draws you in
      to its inner orbit and carries you round a little faster. Squeeze harder for a tighter
      circle. Let go, or FLICK your steering thumb, to launch: toward where you flick or steer, up
      to 60 degrees off the orbit, the whole kick a quarter-turn round. The pair then falls
      together and annihilates, throwing the Charge ripple. A pair you own never pulls you in.
      Space is the pair''s reach - one dial, read live: the orbit''s radius x1 -> x1.4 at level 10
      (StoatSlingConfigSO.orbitReach). R_VesselActions/STOAT_DIPOLE.md section 1b.'
    Input: 2
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Accretion
    UpgradeDescription: 'While you orbit, rival prisms that fall into your attractor are STOLEN
      (yours), and each one adds 4% to the reach of the ripple that pair throws, up to +40%
      (StoatSlingConfigSO.accretionPerPrism / accretionMax).'
  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: Timed Slingshot
    AbilityDescription: 'Passive speed. While a pair is held your flight clock warps and you fly faster: x2.7 at
      rest, 15% more while the orbit holds you. Let go a quarter-turn after the catch (90 deg +-
      15) for the whole launch kick, a fifth of it outside that window; the orbit''s dotted circle
      turns lime inside it. Time is rate - one dial, the Stoat''s warp: x2.7 at rest -> x5.6 at
      level 10 (StoatDipoleConfigSO.boost x StoatSlingConfigSO.catchWarpShare).'
    Input: 0
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Foresight
    UpgradeDescription: 'You also see the predicted paths of the three nearest rivals within 1500 u, in their domain
      colours - each flown 500 u forward on the turn and speed it is holding right now, measured
      from its pose (no input needed). Read a rival''s line and lay your pair across it. Gated on
      IsUpgradeActive(Time), replicated; drawn for the local pilot only
      (StoatPathfinderExecutor.Foresight).'
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: Ripple
    AbilityDescription: 'Passive, anti-vessel and anti-creature. Every pair of yours that annihilates - a
      dipole let go, an orbit''s pair closing after its slingshot - throws a SPACE-TIME
      RIPPLE from where the poles met: a spherical wave that bends the scene as it passes.
      Where its front sweeps over them, rival vessels are STRIPPED of one whole petal of
      every element they hold (shed as crystals around them; a ward against blasts stops
      it) and creatures are killed. It touches no prism, and never you or a teammate. The
      ripple''s reach is the separation the poles had when you let go (x0.6, 30 -> 160 u)
      - Charge scales it x1 -> x2 at level 10 (StoatRippleConfigSO.reach, replicated
      level).'
    Input: 0
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Siphon
    UpgradeDescription: 'The petals the ripple strips come straight to YOU instead of being shed as crystals
      - a rival''s level becomes yours. Gated on IsUpgradeActive(Charge), replicated, so
      every peer moves the same petals (StoatRippleConfigSO.siphonOnChargeUpgrade).'
  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: Heavy Launch
    AbilityDescription: 'Passive. Your launch out of an orbit hits harder: Mass is its momentum - one dial, read
      live: the launch kick x1 at rest -> x2.5 at level 10 (StoatSlingConfigSO.launchPower). Aim
      it by flicking or steering as you let go.'
    Input: 0
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Armoured Wake
    UpgradeDescription: 'The prisms you lay while a launch''s kick lasts (1.5 s) arrive SHIELDED. Gated on
      IsUpgradeActive(Mass), replicated: every peer runs the replicated release, so every peer
      lays the same tier (StoatSlingConfigSO.massUpgradeShieldsLaunchTrail).'
  omniAbilityLabel: Fulmen
